### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Acute client config ping
GET http://localhost:3000/acute-test/ping

### Raw Acute request to /clientsList
GET http://localhost:3000/acute-test/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "/clientsList"
}

### Dry run POST /clientsList with extended timeout
POST http://localhost:3000/acute-test/request?dryRun=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/clientsList",
  "params": {"latestSaveFrom":"2026-01-01T00:00:00", "latestSaveTo":"2026-01-02T00:00:00"},
  "body": {},
  "timeoutMs": 60000
}

### POST /clientsList with extended timeout
POST http://localhost:3000/acute-test/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/clientsList",
  "params": {"latestSaveFrom":"2026-06-30T21:00:00", "latestSaveTo":"2026-07-31T21:00:00"},
  "body": {},
  "timeoutMs": 60000
}

### GET /clientsList and treat ITEM_NOT_FOUND:Client as empty result
POST http://localhost:3000/acute-test/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/clientsList",
  "params": {"latestSaveFrom":"2026-06-30T21:00:00", "latestSaveTo":"2026-07-31T21:00:00"},
  "timeoutMs": 60000,
  "treatItemNotFoundAsEmpty": "Client"
}

### Dry run configured entity fetch for client
POST http://localhost:3000/acute-test/entity/client/fetch?dryRun=true

### Configured entity fetch for client
POST http://localhost:3000/acute-test/entity/client/fetch

### Optional end-to-end sync for client
POST http://localhost:3000/ingestion/sync/client
